                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d497121-9394-30dd-ba10-4def02721abc",
                        "entry_id": "b789f874-8b2b-3374-9977-fd42f36f8858",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To cram together in a jumbled fashion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0c430e3-486a-479d-8015-ffc2cee30510",
                                "sense_id": "2d497121-9394-30dd-ba10-4def02721abc",
                                "text": "And because of the jumbled layout of the city—old prefabs mingling with equally utilitarian new construction and makeshift hovels jimjammed in every which way—an agile person who could jump as well as she could would be able to travel a good distance going from roof to roof."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eb9b9ac5-d460-3993-b437-5725d04e26f7",
                        "entry_id": "b789f874-8b2b-3374-9977-fd42f36f8858",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To befuddle or stupefy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb9c5c33-e1d6-4b92-b3ab-ccb234a10c03",
                                "sense_id": "eb9b9ac5-d460-3993-b437-5725d04e26f7",
                                "text": "I mean my nerves were totally jimjammed ... I was up shit creek, gents!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac22baa5-2a48-4c01-bd98-0c0247630e19",
                                "sense_id": "eb9b9ac5-d460-3993-b437-5725d04e26f7",
                                "text": "\"He's jimjammed on acid, man,\" JoJo said. \"Bad trippin'. Musta got dosed.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "71eedaf3-a78a-3b65-9f6e-22ce6a5471de",
                        "entry_id": "b789f874-8b2b-3374-9977-fd42f36f8858",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To dance ecstatically."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a7e6e7f-3f61-46f5-a71b-e67798edd0ec",
                                "sense_id": "71eedaf3-a78a-3b65-9f6e-22ce6a5471de",
                                "text": "Lights blazed down, but not too strongly, so that the dancers could drift along or jimjam in ecstatic rhythm, in a simulacrum of private worlds."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29e191f7-e5bd-43f8-8c65-54ab6d954882",
                                "sense_id": "71eedaf3-a78a-3b65-9f6e-22ce6a5471de",
                                "text": "They would jimjam and jitterbug flirtatiously up and around the bump in his lower nape and behind the ridge of his ear for a minute or two, and then as if yanked up and away by some resentful mother spider disappear until the next day or the day after when they would dance just a little bit longer than the time before -- until he found he could almost command their presence."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e08dfdd4-501e-397e-9347-f9ac9f956aa5",
                        "entry_id": "b789f874-8b2b-3374-9977-fd42f36f8858",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To copulate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "euphemistic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53a8485e-368c-45f1-84c7-f82836aaf2a8",
                                "sense_id": "e08dfdd4-501e-397e-9347-f9ac9f956aa5",
                                "text": "It didn't work until she spiked his orange juice with a triple dose of street acid: she sent three different girls up that day, and he fucked, sucked, and orifically jimjammed his little brains loose."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
